  "dataSourceInstructions": "fact_usage_event has one row per usage event. It relates to dim_tenant on tenant_id, dim_user on user_key, dim_feature on feature_id and dim_date on event_date (to dim_date[date]). Prefer the measures in fact_usage_event over column aggregations. event_type is the kind of interaction and duration_seconds its duration. dim_user[event_count] is a lifetime total per user, not a period-aware measure; use Events for period questions.",
